<!--
	Own face templates for the horde. Not a cosmetic nicety: MBBodyProperty is an
	MBObjectBase, so it is a single shared instance per id. ZombieTroopSetup
	rewrites the pigmentation of these templates at runtime, and doing that to
	BodyProperty.looter would turn every vanilla looter green as well.

	Keys and tags are copied verbatim from SandBoxCore/sandboxcore_bodyproperties.xml
	(zombie_male <- looter, zombie_female <- townswoman_empire); only the skin
	colour is changed, and that happens in code.
-->
